  - m_Id: 85002285056
    m_Localized: "\rClick on the passage in front"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47006202982400
    m_Localized: 'How to play

      WASD - movement

      Mouse - looking around

      LMB
      - "hearing" mode

      Esc/Space - pause (recommended to read!)



      Look
      for <b><u>arrows</u></b> when activating "hearing" mode - they will lead you
      out!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47188420325376
    m_Localized: Info
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47411481800704
    m_Localized: "Made with love and for fun in 72 hours by Pumpkin Games Team:\r\n\r\r\naxelous
      - game design, balance, level polyshing, sounds\nMrKukushenok - coding, shaders,
      levels\r\n\rSea_Jelly - 3d models (monsters, pickable items)\nRoman NNk - environment
      models\n---v. 1.0---\nArugaf - help with code\r\nXlebusheck1 - 3d models (monsters
      and traps), level 1 adjustments\r\r\nKH21 - initial sounds and main themes\r\n\r\nPumpkin
      - our CEO and team's main cat!\r\n\r\nThanks for plaiyng, we would love to
      hear your feedback! <3"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
